---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms and Conditions for BBK Marketing Solutions LLC."
  effectiveDate="March 11, 2026"
  updatedDate="March 11, 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing the services, website, advertising campaigns, or marketing platforms operated by
    {site.legalName} (&ldquo;BBK Marketing&rdquo;, &ldquo;Company&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;,
    or &ldquo;our&rdquo;), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.
  </p>
  <p>If you do not agree with these terms, you must not use our services.</p>

  <h2>2. Description of Services</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName} provides digital marketing and consulting services including but not limited to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Digital advertising campaign management</li>
    <li>Lead generation services</li>
    <li>Marketing consulting</li>
    <li>Social media advertising</li>
    <li>Online campaign optimization</li>
    <li>Marketing strategy development</li>
  </ul>
  <p>BBK Marketing operates as a marketing and advertising service provider.</p>
  <p>
    The company does not guarantee specific commercial, financial, or business outcomes resulting from
    marketing campaigns.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Client Responsibilities</h2>
  <p>Clients agree to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide accurate and truthful information required for campaign creation</li>
    <li>Ensure that their products, services, or research activities comply with all applicable laws and regulations</li>
    <li>Obtain any required regulatory approvals (including IRB approvals for clinical research campaigns where applicable)</li>
    <li>Respond to generated leads in a timely manner</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    BBK Marketing is not responsible for client-side operations, including sales, patient screening, or
    customer follow-up.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Lead Generation Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>BBK Marketing Solutions provides lead generation services only.</p>
  <p>We do not guarantee:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The quality of leads</li>
    <li>Conversion rates</li>
    <li>Sales performance</li>
    <li>Patient enrollment in clinical studies</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Leads represent individuals who have voluntarily submitted their information through advertising campaigns.</p>
  <p>Final qualification and verification of leads is the responsibility of the client.</p>

  <h2>5. Clinical Research Campaigns</h2>
  <p>When BBK Marketing manages campaigns related to clinical research studies, the following applies:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>BBK Marketing does not conduct medical research.</li>
    <li>BBK Marketing does not provide medical advice.</li>
    <li>BBK Marketing does not determine study eligibility.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    All medical screening, study participation, and patient eligibility decisions are handled exclusively
    by the research organization conducting the study.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Payments and Fees</h2>
  <p>Clients agree to pay all fees associated with services provided by BBK Marketing Solutions.</p>
  <p>Unless otherwise stated in writing:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Payments are non-refundable</li>
    <li>Campaign costs may include advertising budgets paid directly to platforms such as Meta or Google</li>
    <li>Administrative or setup fees may apply</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Failure to complete payment may result in suspension or termination of services.</p>

  <h2>7. Advertising Platforms</h2>
  <p>Marketing campaigns may run on third-party platforms including but not limited to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram)</li>
    <li>Google Ads</li>
    <li>TikTok</li>
    <li>Other digital advertising networks</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    BBK Marketing is not responsible for platform outages, algorithm changes, account restrictions, or
    advertising approval decisions made by these platforms.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
  <p>All materials created by BBK Marketing, including but not limited to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Advertising creatives</li>
    <li>Marketing strategies</li>
    <li>Campaign structures</li>
    <li>Graphic assets</li>
    <li>Written content</li>
  </ul>
  <p>remain the intellectual property of {site.legalName} unless otherwise agreed in writing.</p>
  <p>Clients receive a license to use campaign materials for the duration of the marketing engagement.</p>

  <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, {site.legalName} shall not be liable for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Loss of revenue</li>
    <li>Loss of profits</li>
    <li>Loss of business opportunities</li>
    <li>Indirect or consequential damages</li>
  </ul>
  <p>arising from the use of our services.</p>
  <p>Total liability, if any, shall not exceed the amount paid for services in the preceding 30 days.</p>

  <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
  <p>Clients agree to indemnify and hold harmless {site.legalName} against any claims, damages, or liabilities arising from:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The client&rsquo;s business activities</li>
    <li>Misleading advertising claims provided by the client</li>
    <li>Regulatory violations by the client</li>
    <li>Misuse of marketing materials</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>11. Termination of Services</h2>
  <p>BBK Marketing reserves the right to terminate services at any time if:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The client violates these Terms</li>
    <li>Payment obligations are not fulfilled</li>
    <li>The client engages in unlawful activities</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Upon termination, any unpaid balances remain due.</p>

  <h2>12. Confidentiality</h2>
  <p>
    Both parties agree to keep confidential any proprietary or sensitive information shared during the
    business relationship, including marketing strategies, campaign data, and business operations.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Governing Law</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and interpreted under the laws of the State of
    Florida, United States, without regard to conflict of law principles.
  </p>

  <h2>14. Changes to Terms</h2>
  <p>{site.legalName} reserves the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time.</p>
  <p>Updated versions will be posted on the official website.</p>
  <p>Continued use of services constitutes acceptance of any modifications.</p>

  <h2>15. Contact Information</h2>
  <p>For questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact:</p>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}<br />
    {site.address}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
